## sn45.1
sn45.1:1.1 | S: So I have heard. | T: I have heard that
sn45.1:1.2 | S: At one time the Buddha was staying near Sāvatthī in Jeta’s Grove, Anāthapiṇḍika’s monastery. | T: on one occasion the Blessed One was staying near Sāvatthī in Jeta’s Grove, Anāthapiṇḍika’s monastery.
sn45.1:1.3 | S: There the Buddha addressed the mendicants, | T: There he addressed the monks,
sn45.1:1.4 | S: “Mendicants!” | T: “Monks!”
sn45.1:1.5 | S: “Venerable sir,” they replied. | T: “Yes, lord,” the monks responded to him.
sn45.1:1.6 | S: The Buddha said this: | T: The Blessed One said,
sn45.1:2.1 | S: “Mendicants, ignorance leads the attainment of unskillful qualities, with lack of conscience and prudence following along. | T: “Monks, ignorance is the leader in the attainment of unskillful qualities, followed by lack of shame & lack of compunction.
sn45.1:2.2 | S: An ignoramus, sunk in ignorance, produces wrong view. | T: In an unknowledgeable person, immersed in ignorance, wrong view arises.
sn45.1:2.3 | S: Wrong view produces wrong purpose. | T: In one of wrong view, wrong resolve arises.
sn45.1:2.4 | S: Wrong purpose produces wrong speech. | T: In one of wrong resolve, wrong speech.…
sn45.1:2.5 | S: Wrong speech produces wrong action. | T: In one of wrong speech, wrong action.…
sn45.1:2.6 | S: Wrong action produces wrong livelihood. | T: In one of wrong action, wrong livelihood.…
sn45.1:2.7 | S: Wrong livelihood produces wrong effort. | T: In one of wrong livelihood, wrong effort.…
sn45.1:2.8 | S: Wrong effort produces wrong mindfulness. | T: In one of wrong effort, wrong mindfulness.…
sn45.1:2.9 | S: Wrong mindfulness produces wrong immersion. | T: In one of wrong mindfulness, wrong concentration arises.
sn45.1:3.1 | S: Knowledge leads the attainment of skillful qualities, with conscience and prudence following along. | T: “Clear knowing is the leader in the attainment of skillful qualities, followed by shame & compunction.
sn45.1:3.2 | S: A knowing one, firm in knowledge, produces right view. | T: In a knowledgeable person, immersed in clear knowing, right view arises.
sn45.1:3.3 | S: Right view produces right purpose. | T: In one of right view, right resolve arises.
sn45.1:3.4 | S: Right purpose produces right speech. | T: In one of right resolve, right speech.…
sn45.1:3.5 | S: Right speech produces right action. | T: In one of right speech, right action.…
sn45.1:3.6 | S: Right action produces right livelihood. | T: In one of right action, right livelihood.…
sn45.1:3.7 | S: Right livelihood produces right effort. | T: In one of right livelihood, right effort.…
sn45.1:3.8 | S: Right effort produces right mindfulness. | T: In one of right effort, right mindfulness.…
sn45.1:3.9 | S: Right mindfulness produces right immersion.” | T: In one of right mindfulness, right concentration arises.”
sn45.1:3.10 | P: Paṭhamaṁ. | T: (none)

## sn45.2
sn45.2:1.1 | S: So I have heard. | T: I have heard that
