sn45.2:2.2 | S: Good friends, companions, and associates are the whole of the spiritual life. | T: Having admirable people as friends, companions, & colleagues is actually the whole of the holy life.
sn45.2:2.3 | S: A mendicant with good friends, companions, and associates can expect to develop and cultivate the noble eightfold path. | T: When a monk has admirable people as friends, companions, & colleagues, he can be expected to develop & pursue the noble eightfold path.
